Description: draw and touch up pictures
 Easel is a simple drawing program for quick pictures and touch-ups, in the
 style of Paint in Windows XP. It has the classic tools, exact pixels, undo,
 selections you can move and stretch, text boxes and printing.
 .
 This is a beta.
